Only the modules actually imported are vendored. three.module.js re-exports from
three.core.js (upstream split, not ours). GLTFLoader pulls BufferGeometryUtils and
SkeletonUtils; meshopt_decoder is dynamically imported only when a web derivative
carrying EXT_meshopt_compression is loaded.

KTX2 (T-2582, vendored 2026-10-16 from the same tarball): KTX2Loader pulls WorkerPool,
ktx-parse, zstddec and math/ColorSpaces; it fetches the Basis Universal transcoder
(libs/basis/basis_transcoder.js + .wasm, Apache-2.0, Binomial LLC, shipped inside the
three tarball) relative to its own module URL, only the first time a .ktx2 is loaded.

